+/-!
+# `rand_core::OsRng`
+
+The operating system RNG is external code: its `try_*` methods are opaque. Nothing can be
+proved about them; what a development assumes of them (for instance that they do not fail and
+return bytes sampled with `Result.random`) is stated as a hypothesis of its theorems.
